---
import PageLayout from '../../layouts/PageLayout.astro';
---

<PageLayout title="The Delivery Hero" description="A delivery guy, a jetpack fantasy, and one security camera chirp">
  <article class="project">
    <div class="container">
      <header class="project-header">
        <h1 class="project-title">The Delivery Hero</h1>
        <p class="project-tagline">A delivery guy, a jetpack fantasy, and one security camera chirp</p>
      </header>

      <div class="project-hero">
        <div class="video-wrapper">
          <iframe
            src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/6U2-dWd2yRk"
            title="The Delivery Hero - AI-generated spec ad"
            frameborder="0"
            allow="accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture"
            allowfullscreen
            class="hero-video"
          ></iframe>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="project-content">
        <section class="content-section">
          <h2>What it is</h2>
          <p>
            An 18-second spec ad and visual comedy. A delivery worker imagines himself as a hero from a 1950s sci-fi comic, with jetpack flames, brass horns and slow-motion flight over garden gnomes. A security camera chirp snaps him back to reality, and he sets the package on a velvet pillow, salutes, and slips away. The homeowner watches the replay and raises one eyebrow.
          </p>
          <p>
            It is a spec concept for a security camera product, with no real delivery service or client behind it.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section class="content-section">
          <h2>What problem it solves</h2>
          <p>
            A doorstep camera sees what people do when they think no one is watching. This film makes that idea fun to watch by showing two versions of one delivery: the one in his head and the one on camera.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section class="content-section">
          <h2>Core idea</h2>
          <p>
            Two visual languages, one character. The fantasy is theatrical, retro and loud. The reality is flat, minimal and quiet.
          </p>
          <p>
            The security alert is the cut between them, and the FRAGILE package is the one prop that appears in both.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section class="content-section">
          <h2>Structure</h2>
          <ul>
            <li>Clip 1, Fantasy (0:00–0:05): the retro sci-fi superhero delivery</li>
            <li>Clip 2, Snap (0:05–0:08): the camera chirp ends the fantasy</li>
            <li>Clip 3, Pivot (0:08–0:14): flamingo-pose freeze, careful package handling, a small salute, a quiet exit</li>
            <li>Clip 4, Payoff (0:14–0:18): the homeowner replays the footage with an arched eyebrow</li>
          </ul>
        </section>

        <section class="content-section">
          <h2>Approach & methods</h2>
          <ul>
            <li>A 1950s sci-fi comic look for the fantasy, set against a flat minimalist look for reality</li>
            <li>An audio cue, not a visual one, as the trigger for the shift between the two modes</li>
            <li>Exaggerated heroism followed by exaggerated caution, so the second half reverses the first</li>
            <li>The package kept as the central prop in every clip for continuity</li>
            <li>An understated final reaction, so the viewer gets the joke without dialogue</li>
          </ul>
        </section>

        <section class="content-section">
          <h2>Tools</h2>
          <ul>
            <li>Image generation: GPT Image 2.5 Sunburst, Nano Banana 2.1</li>
            <li>Video generation: Seedance 2.5, Veo 3 Fast</li>
            <li>Sound design & music: ElevenLabs</li>
            <li>Editing & compositing: Adobe Premiere Pro, After Effects</li>
          </ul>
        </section>
      </div>
    </div>
  </article>
</PageLayout>

<style>
  .project {
    padding-top: clamp(6rem, 12vw, 10rem);
    padding-bottom: clamp(4rem, 8vw, 6rem);
  }

  .project-header {
    margin-bottom: clamp(3rem, 6vw, 5rem);
  }

  .project-title {
    font-size: clamp(2.5rem, 6vw, 4.5rem);
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  .project-tagline {
    font-size: clamp(1.25rem, 2.5vw, 1.75rem);
    opacity: 0.7;
  }

  .project-hero {
    margin-bottom: clamp(4rem, 8vw, 6rem);
  }

  .video-wrapper {
    position: relative;
    width: 100%;
    padding-bottom: 56.25%; /* 16:9 aspect ratio */
    height: 0;
    overflow: hidden;
    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
  }

  .hero-video {
    position: absolute;
    top: 0;
    left: 0;
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    border: none;
  }

  .project-content {
    max-width: 800px;
  }

  .content-section {
    margin-bottom: clamp(3rem, 6vw, 4rem);
  }

  .content-section h2 {
    font-size: clamp(1.5rem, 3vw, 2rem);
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  .content-section p {
    font-size: clamp(1rem, 2vw, 1.125rem);
    line-height: 1.7;
    opacity: 0.9;
  }

  .content-section ul {
    list-style: none;
    padding: 0;
  }

  .content-section li {
    font-size: clamp(1rem, 2vw, 1.125rem);
    line-height: 1.7;
    opacity: 0.9;
    padding-left: 1.5rem;
    position: relative;
  }

  .content-section li::before {
    content: '—';
    position: absolute;
    left: 0;
  }
</style>
